# Dev-only empty placeholder for the dev bind mount
# (-v .../teaching-memories.sql:/app/teaching-memories.sql:ro). It was git rm'd
# in the Skills-architecture commit and is no longer COPY'd by Dockerfile.linux,
# so it must NOT be tracked — but the dev mount needs the file to exist on disk to
# mount it. Ignoring it keeps the ship's porcelain hard-gate clean without
# breaking the dev mount. (Recurring gremlin, settled 2026-05-30.)
